   _item_type.code           float
   _mmfdb_schema.table_name  flr_chisurf_parameter
   _mmfdb_schema.column_name r_ss_i
   _item_description.description
;     Intensity-domain steady-state anisotropy. For dual-channel data, ChiSurf background-corrects VV and VH (per-channel metadata when available), compensates objective mixing via l1/l2, and evaluates rS,I from channel sums using the ChiSurf convention r = (VV - VH) / (g*VV + 2*VH). For single-channel fallback, VM is reconstructed from the active anisotropy model before summation.
;
