   _mmfdb_schema.table_name  flr_chisurf_parameter
   _mmfdb_schema.column_name r_ss_l
   _item_description.description
;     Lifetime-domain steady-state anisotropy derived from the model lifetime spectrum and rotational spectrum. This value is model-predicted (spectrum/integral domain) and does not depend on direct VV/VH channel integration.
;
