   _item_type.code           float
   _mmfdb_schema.table_name  flr_chisurf_parameter
   _mmfdb_schema.column_name rics_frame_dur
   _item_description.description
;     Frame time t_frame in ms. Converts a frame lag Delta into a lag time via tau = |xi*t_pixel + psi*t_line + Delta*t_frame|, so it scales every diffusion coefficient derived from frame lags (STICS/TICS/iMSD).
;
