save_mmfdb_operation_parameter_def
   _category.id              mmfdb_operation_parameter_def
   _category.description
;     Typed parameter schema for an operation type — the data-side analog of a
;     chinet node's typed ports.  One row per (operation_type, name) declares the
;     type, units, default, bounds, whether the parameter is required, and whether
;     it is repeatable (role-indexed).  Operation parameter rows in mmfdb_parameter
;     are validated against this schema at registration.
;
   _category.mandatory_code  no
   _category_key.name        "_mmfdb_operation_parameter_def.def_id"

