save_mmfdb_reagent_lot
   _category.id              mmfdb_reagent_lot
   _category.description
;     A consumable lot — a fluorophore/buffer/optical-filter/kit with lot number and
;     expiry — so a result can tie to exactly what was used.  Linked to operations /
;     setups / samples through mmfdb_reagent_usage (orthogonal; no columns added to
;     those tables).  A fluorophore lot may optionally reference a known probe.
;
   _category.mandatory_code  no
   _category_key.name        "_mmfdb_reagent_lot.lot_id"

