save_flr_analysis_feature
   _category.id              flr_analysis_feature
   _category.description
;     Computed per-event observables of an analysis -- the feature vocabulary
;     behind burst summaries (.bur columns), per-pixel and per-region MLE
;     tables and related exports. Distinct from flr_chisurf_parameter, which
;     holds *fitted model parameters*: an analysis feature is measured or
;     derived per burst / pixel / region, not optimised.
;
;     This category is the central drift point the general rule demands:
;     an analysis declaration file (e.g. chisurf burst_features.yaml,
;     result_columns.yaml) may only use terms defined here or in
;     flr_chisurf_parameter, so a new feature is created HERE first and the
;     declarations reference it. Where flrCIF/PDBx defines an equivalent
;     item, prefer that definition; these are the terms it does not carry.
;
   _category.mandatory_code  no
   _category_key.name        "_flr_analysis_feature.id"

save__flr_analysis_feature.id
   _item.name                "_flr_analysis_feature.id"
   _item.category_id         flr_analysis_feature
   _item_type.code           int
   _item.mandatory_code      yes
   _mmfdb_schema.table_name  flr_analysis_feature
   _mmfdb_schema.column_name id

