   _mmfdb_schema.table_name  flr_analysis_feature
   _mmfdb_schema.column_name first_photon
   _item_description.description
;     Index of the event's first photon in the measurement's photon stream (per detector: first photon of that detector within the event; -1 when the detector saw none).
;

